        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"contents\": [{\n    \"parts\": [\n      { \"text\": \"Look at this image carefully. Respond ONLY in valid JSON, no markdown formatting, in this exact shape:\\n{\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"a clear, detailed description of what is actually visible in the image \\u2014 the scene, objects, people, layout, on-screen text, UI elements, or whatever is shown\\\",\\n  \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"3-5 relevant tags\\\"],\\n  \\\"problem\\\": \\\"what need or problem this image addresses, if any\\\",\\n  \\\"claim\\\": \\\"if the image contains a specific factual statement, statistic, named tool/website/brand, instruction, or claim that could be checked/verified, quote or name it here EXACTLY as shown, including exact names \\u2014 do not generalize or summarize it into a category. If there is no such checkable claim in the image, set this to null.\\\"\\n}\\n\\nRules:\\n- summary must describe the actual visual content, not just repeat the caption.\\n- claim must preserve exact proper nouns, numbers, names, or text exactly as they appear in the image \\u2014 never replace them with generic descriptions.\\n- If multiple claims are present, pick the single most important/central one.\\n\\nCaption if provided by user: {{ $('Code in JavaScript6').item.json.caption }}\" },\n      { \"inline_data\": { \"mime_type\": \"image/jpeg\", \"data\": \"{{ $json.data }}\" } }\n    ]\n  }]\n}",
        "options": {}
