        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"contents\": [\n    {\n      \"parts\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Watch and listen to this video carefully, all the way through. Respond ONLY in valid JSON, no markdown, in this exact shape:\\n{\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"a detailed, specific description of exactly what this video shows and says. If it names specific tools, apps, websites, products, brands, techniques, or steps, list each one by its EXACT name as stated in the video, along with a short note on what that specific item is used for or does. Do not generalize named items into a category (e.g. do not write just tools for X, name the actual tools). If the video does not name anything specific, describe the general content and method shown instead.\\\",\\n  \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"3-5 relevant tags\\\"],\\n  \\\"problem\\\": \\\"what problem or need this video addresses\\\",\\n  \\\"claim\\\": \\\"if the video makes a specific factual statement, statistic, instruction, or names a tool/website/brand/technique that could be checked or verified, state it here EXACTLY as said in the video, preserving exact names and numbers. If multiple such claims exist, pick the single most important or central one. If there is no checkable claim, set this to null.\\\"\\n}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"fileData\": {\n            \"mimeType\": \"video/mp4\",\n            \"fileUri\": \"{{ $('Upload a media file1').item.json.fileUri }}\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
